{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 3022077333969658072,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "ARM64 Memory Model",
      "source_hash": 6798914735927561614,
      "context_hash": 6777433639773857377,
      "translation": "ARM64 메모리 모델",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Memory Model": "메모리 모델"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:58:33.168105Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Weak ordering, barriers, and atomic operations on ARM64",
      "source_hash": 3745013421732034115,
      "context_hash": 17253687941636716045,
      "translation": "ARM64의 약한 순서, 배리어, 원자적 연산",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:58:33.168105Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "ARM64 is weakly ordered",
      "source_hash": 14256017297044336865,
      "context_hash": 8695907229106591829,
      "translation": "ARM64는 약한 순서를 따릅니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:58:33.168105Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Unlike x86 (which has TSO — Total Store Order, nearly sequentially consistent), ARM64 has a **weakly ordered** memory model.",
      "source_hash": 10569549210412241576,
      "context_hash": 2333982594889332766,
      "translation": "거의 순차적 일관성을 갖는 TSO(Total Store Order)를 따르는 x86과 달리, ARM64는 **약한 순서(weakly ordered)** 메모리 모델을 따릅니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Memory Model": "메모리 모델"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:58:33.168105Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "The hardware may reorder loads and stores for performance:",
      "source_hash": 7534604501788500399,
      "context_hash": 5797702256789580644,
      "translation": "하드웨어는 성능을 위해 load와 store의 순서를 바꿀 수 있습니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "hardware": "하드웨어"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:58:33.168106Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "This matters for lock-free algorithms and any code that synchronizes between threads without using explicit atomic operations.",
      "source_hash": 504016744888050495,
      "context_hash": 6608537054589173255,
      "translation": "이는 lock-free 알고리즘과, 명시적인 원자적 연산을 사용하지 않고 스레드 간에 동기화하는 모든 코드에서 중요합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:58:33.168106Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "What ARM64 guarantees",
      "source_hash": 4952965189844174932,
      "context_hash": 10153455768240466944,
      "translation": "ARM64가 보장하는 것",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:58:33.168106Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "**Single-copy atomicity**: A naturally-aligned load or store of a single register is atomic (the value is either fully written or not written).",
      "source_hash": 1050344183399427825,
      "context_hash": 12153190099059246252,
      "translation": "**단일 복사 원자성(single-copy atomicity)**: 자연 정렬된 단일 레지스터의 load 또는 store는 원자적입니다(값은 완전히 기록되거나 전혀 기록되지 않습니다).",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:58:33.168106Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "**Program order for dependent accesses**: If load A is used to compute the address of load B, B observes the effects of A (data-dependent ordering).",
      "source_hash": 5878961037411152565,
      "context_hash": 11795577218951754973,
      "translation": "**의존적 접근에 대한 프로그램 순서**: load A가 load B의 주소를 계산하는 데 사용되면, B는 A의 효과를 관찰합니다(데이터 의존 순서).",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "address": "주소"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:58:33.168106Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "**No guarantees for independent accesses**: Stores and loads to unrelated addresses can be observed in any order by other CPUs.",
      "source_hash": 7119816676876097532,
      "context_hash": 16591441161270414806,
      "translation": "**독립적 접근에 대한 보장 없음**: 서로 관련 없는 주소에 대한 store와 load는 다른 CPU에서 임의의 순서로 관찰될 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:58:33.168106Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Memory barrier instructions",
      "source_hash": 9448382242076758781,
      "context_hash": 16948317602209537485,
      "translation": "메모리 배리어 명령어",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "memory": "메모리"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:58:33.168106Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "ARM64 provides three barrier instructions:",
      "source_hash": 1302604017081855263,
      "context_hash": 9435976852859438388,
      "translation": "ARM64는 세 가지 배리어 명령어를 제공합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:58:33.168106Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "DMB: Data Memory Barrier",
      "source_hash": 18104049281967703686,
      "context_hash": 12322768691248925347,
      "translation": "DMB: Data Memory Barrier",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:58:33.168106Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Ensures memory accesses before the barrier are visible before accesses after it:",
      "source_hash": 861307679482969265,
      "context_hash": 2188002239807770601,
      "translation": "배리어 이전의 메모리 접근이 배리어 이후의 접근보다 먼저 보이도록 보장합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "memory access": "메모리 접근"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:58:33.168106Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "`SY` (full system) is most conservative. `ISH` is typical for SMP kernels.",
      "source_hash": 10049385121028955142,
      "context_hash": 8944392660475808755,
      "translation": "`SY`(전체 시스템)가 가장 보수적입니다. SMP 커널에서는 일반적으로 `ISH`를 사용합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "kernels": "커널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:58:33.168106Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "DSB: Data Synchronization Barrier",
      "source_hash": 209694484353998173,
      "context_hash": 5825691740099402299,
      "translation": "DSB: Data Synchronization Barrier",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:58:33.168106Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "Stronger than DMB: not only are memory accesses ordered, but **the barrier stalls the pipeline** until all prior memory accesses are complete:",
      "source_hash": 3311160921390354311,
      "context_hash": 8128210809077334766,
      "translation": "DMB보다 강력합니다. 메모리 접근의 순서가 지켜질 뿐 아니라, 이전의 모든 메모리 접근이 완료될 때까지 **배리어가 파이프라인을 멈춥니다**:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "memory access": "메모리 접근"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:58:33.168106Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:9/seg:0",
      "source": "Use DSB when you need to know memory accesses have *completed* (not just ordered) — e.g., before modifying page tables that the MMU might be walking, or before a cache maintenance operation takes effect.",
      "source_hash": 10229960972267509272,
      "context_hash": 5985358617883026999,
      "translation": "메모리 접근이 (순서만 지켜진 것이 아니라) *완료되었음*을 알아야 할 때 DSB를 사용하십시오. 예를 들어 MMU가 탐색 중일 수 있는 페이지 테이블을 수정하기 전이나, 캐시 유지 관리 연산이 효력을 발휘하기 전에 사용합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "MMU": "MMU",
        "memory access": "메모리 접근",
        "page table": "페이지 테이블"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:58:33.168107Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:10/seg:0",
      "source": "ISB: Instruction Synchronization Barrier",
      "source_hash": 2945983711228039284,
      "context_hash": 16710505041202399711,
      "translation": "ISB: Instruction Synchronization Barrier",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:58:33.168107Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:11/seg:0",
      "source": "Flushes the instruction pipeline:",
      "source_hash": 6565573888182741663,
      "context_hash": 16349090501504697774,
      "translation": "명령어 파이프라인을 비웁니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:58:33.168107Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:13/seg:0",
      "source": "Use ISB after:",
      "source_hash": 15249889749088168976,
      "context_hash": 14458096804941117867,
      "translation": "다음 작업 후에 ISB를 사용하십시오:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:58:33.168107Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:14/seg:0",
      "source": "Writing to system registers that affect instruction execution (e.g., SCTLR_EL1)",
      "source_hash": 5887556351394617280,
      "context_hash": 2151347019099450948,
      "translation": "명령어 실행에 영향을 주는 시스템 레지스터(예: SCTLR_EL1)에 쓰기",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:58:33.168107Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:15/seg:0",
      "source": "Self-modifying code",
      "source_hash": 4347753410036947554,
      "context_hash": 13395015235987828968,
      "translation": "자체 수정 코드",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:58:33.168107Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:16/seg:0",
      "source": "Changing the instruction cache attributes",
      "source_hash": 9265869954067698324,
      "context_hash": 10712980020488078370,
      "translation": "명령어 캐시 속성 변경",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "cache": "캐시"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:58:33.168107Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:17/seg:0",
      "source": "Without ISB, the CPU might have already fetched and decoded instructions past the system register write.",
      "source_hash": 13806277979612355959,
      "context_hash": 2256698819191760033,
      "translation": "ISB가 없으면 CPU가 시스템 레지스터 쓰기 이후의 명령어를 이미 fetch하고 디코딩했을 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:58:33.168107Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Load-acquire and Store-release",
      "source_hash": 1378884246378463011,
      "context_hash": 15453122165002652896,
      "translation": "Load-acquire와 Store-release",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:58:33.168107Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "ARM64 provides special atomic load/store variants that include ordering semantics:",
      "source_hash": 11696516955750626521,
      "context_hash": 9577790060507780991,
      "translation": "ARM64는 순서 의미론을 포함하는 특수한 원자적 load/store 변형을 제공합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:58:33.168107Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "These implement the C11/C++11 `memory_order_acquire` and `memory_order_release` semantics efficiently — no explicit DMB needed.",
      "source_hash": 17544842824407811083,
      "context_hash": 1396684605724539774,
      "translation": "이 명령어들은 C11/C++11의 `memory_order_acquire`와 `memory_order_release` 의미론을 효율적으로 구현하므로, 명시적인 DMB가 필요하지 않습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:58:33.168107Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Exclusive load/store (atomics)",
      "source_hash": 11320691375753408034,
      "context_hash": 12941206215900526382,
      "translation": "배타적 load/store(원자적 연산)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:58:33.168107Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "ARM64 atomics use a load-link/store-conditional (LL/SC) mechanism:",
      "source_hash": 13246813430637098132,
      "context_hash": 8741548778082521750,
      "translation": "ARM64의 원자적 연산은 LL/SC(load-link/store-conditional) 메커니즘을 사용합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:58:33.168108Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "ARMv8.1 adds **Large System Extensions (LSE)** — single-instruction atomics that avoid the retry loop:",
      "source_hash": 4121219004909133401,
      "context_hash": 125121723523938128,
      "translation": "ARMv8.1은 재시도 루프를 피하는 단일 명령어 원자적 연산인 **LSE**(Large System Extensions)를 추가합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:58:33.168108Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "LSE atomics are preferred on systems with many cores — they generate a single bus transaction rather than potentially many retry loops.",
      "source_hash": 507689086081907111,
      "context_hash": 8130805752879690239,
      "translation": "코어가 많은 시스템에서는 LSE 원자적 연산이 선호됩니다. 여러 번 반복될 수 있는 재시도 루프 대신 단 한 번의 버스 트랜잭션만 발생시키기 때문입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "transaction": "트랜잭션"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:58:33.168108Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Linux kernel barrier macros on ARM64",
      "source_hash": 8917697049080706069,
      "context_hash": 18066119852596143728,
      "translation": "ARM64에서의 Linux 커널 배리어 매크로",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Linux": "Linux",
        "macro": "매크로"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:51:23.750795Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The kernel provides architecture-independent macros that map to ARM64 instructions:",
      "source_hash": 11552828046028285316,
      "context_hash": 15289180893963956392,
      "translation": "커널은 ARM64 명령어에 대응하는 아키텍처 독립적인 매크로를 제공합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "macro": "매크로"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:51:23.750796Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "When to use which",
      "source_hash": 2916614973984130387,
      "context_hash": 810033435358703293,
      "translation": "상황별 사용법",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:51:23.750797Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Page table barriers",
      "source_hash": 8756253025171723604,
      "context_hash": 7358165890220237566,
      "translation": "페이지 테이블 배리어",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "page table": "페이지 테이블"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:51:23.750797Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "A common ARM64 specific need: after modifying a page table entry, you must ensure the store is visible to the MMU before the TLB invalidation instruction:",
      "source_hash": 9223227560389452153,
      "context_hash": 17587035925679443796,
      "translation": "ARM64에서 흔히 필요한 작업으로, 페이지 테이블 엔트리를 수정한 후에는 TLB 무효화 명령어보다 먼저 그 저장(store)이 MMU에 보이도록 보장해야 합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "MMU": "MMU",
        "TLB": "TLB",
        "page table entry": "페이지 테이블 엔트리"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:51:23.750798Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "In the kernel:",
      "source_hash": 14915533112752995074,
      "context_hash": 15318656833645787361,
      "translation": "커널에서는 다음과 같습니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "kernel": "커널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:51:23.750798Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Acquire/Release in the kernel: spinlock",
      "source_hash": 13258739244246885252,
      "context_hash": 947266639054414466,
      "translation": "커널의 Acquire/Release: 스핀락",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "kernel": "커널",
        "spinlock": "스핀락"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:51:23.750798Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Weak memory model bugs",
      "source_hash": 17693458561427900455,
      "context_hash": 14720006387137843872,
      "translation": "약한 메모리 모델 버그",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Memory Model": "메모리 모델",
        "bugs": "버그"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:51:23.750798Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Common patterns that work on x86 (TSO) but **fail on ARM64**:",
      "source_hash": 7054067373765148204,
      "context_hash": 2287796738550224480,
